The ordered necessity bridge reconstructs the chosen eigenvalue witness from the frozen spectral_reduction proof term; it is bind-only proof reuse.
Matrix.PosSemidef, Matrix.IsHermitian.spectral_theorem, and the frozen SVD and rearrangement results supply the matrix foundations.
The Bell matrix and permutation unitaries are QutritSpectralReduction.bell and QutritSpectralReduction.permutationU.
